  Examples:
    Here is an example of implementing simple NumPy-style broadcasting:

    >>> import jax.numpy as jnp
    >>> from jax import lax
    >>> import numpy as np

    >>> arr = jnp.arange(3).reshape(3, 1)
    >>> target_shape = (2, 3, 4)
    >>> result = lax.broadcast_in_dim(arr, target_shape, broadcast_dimensions=(1, 2))
    >>> result.shape
